      {
        "id": 121500,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-26T16:21:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The number one reason for Operative to be like she is is the win condition and cards like Cedistic Dissonant and End of days.</p><p>\"Unless otherwise stated when a villain character card is destroyed the heroes win the game.\"</p><p>Having Operative not a Villain Character saves having to state otherwise.</p><p>Having her a character makes her immune to End of Days and Cedistic Dissonant, both of which cannot destroy character cards.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:55:05.521Z",
