        "raw": "<p>The number one reason for Operative to be like she is is the win condition and cards like Cedistic Dissonant and End of days.</p><p>&quot;Unless otherwise stated when a villain character card is destroyed the heroes win the game.&quot;</p><p>Having Operative not a Villain Character saves having to state otherwise.</p><p>Having her a character makes her immune to End of Days and Cedistic Dissonant, both of which cannot destroy character cards.</p>",
